OL,3,GNEWSA'Unforeseen staffing issues' close
OL,4,AKirkwall's air traffic control
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights to and from Kirkwall in Orkney
OL,7,Fwere cancelled after "unforeseen
OL,8,Fstaffing issues" closed the airport's
OL,9,Fair traffic control.
OL,11,FLoganair's Edinburgh - Kirkwall return
OL,12,Fservice and the Aberdeen - Kirkwall
OL,13,Fflight on Wednesday - as well as
OL,14,FThursday morning's Kirkwall - Aberdeen
OL,15,Fservice - were affected.
OL,17,FHighlands and Islands Airports Ltd
OL,18,F(Hial) said that "regrettably" it had
OL,19,Fnot been possible to plan the closures
OL,20,Faround the flight schedule.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
